 CP_*
$ENDFPLIST
DRAW
A 0 -150 128 1287 513 0 1 20 N -80 -50 80 -50
P 2 0 1 20 -80 30 80 30 N
P 2 0 1 0 -70 90 -30 90 N
P 2 0 1 0 -50 70 -50 110 N
X ~ 1 0 150 110 D 50 50 1 1 P
X ~ 2 0 -150 130 U 50 50 1 1 P
ENDDRAW
ENDDEF
